WEBVTT

00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:00.436
Nothing makes a Dane proud

00:01:00.476 --> 00:01:03.196
like the knowledge
that something we have done

00:01:03.196 --> 00:01:06.476
makes a positive difference in the world.

00:01:07.276 --> 00:01:12.156
Historically speaking,
we’ve made a difference before.

00:01:12.196 --> 00:01:17.436
1,000 years ago, countrymen of mine
controlled most of northern Europe.

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:18.996
I'm sure you've heard of them.

00:01:19.396 --> 00:01:22.556
Big, strong guys,
helmets, beards, long hair.

00:01:23.156 --> 00:01:24.676
The Vikings.

00:01:24.716 --> 00:01:26.196
Now I will make the case today

00:01:26.236 --> 00:01:28.356
that in order for us
to fight climate change,

00:01:28.356 --> 00:01:31.156
we actually need to learn
from the Vikings.